<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionIRI> <http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem/0.1.0> .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <http://w3id.org/circularfactory/Core> .
