<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#isStepOfReprocessingOperation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relates a process run to the reprocessing operation it belongs to. Replaces the middleware term 'partOfReprocessingOperation'."@en .
