<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#reprocessesComponent> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#reprocessesComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://w3id.org/circularfactory/Core#hasInputWorkpiece> .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#reprocessesComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#ReprocessingOperation> .
