<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#reprocessesComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relates a reprocessing operation to the component it reprocesses. The component identity is managed by production control. The range is cfc:Workpiece; the middleware draft used cfc:Resource, which is disjoint with cfc:Workpiece in Core 0.9.0."@en .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#reprocessesComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "reprocesses component"@en .
