# http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/standardUncertainty
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/standardUncertainty> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
# 
# http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasCausticOvality
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasCausticOvality> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasCausticOvality> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#PowderCausticImageStack> .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasCausticOvality> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal> .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasCausticOvality> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Shortcut for the second Fourier order of the powder caustic cross-section (dimensionless) derived from a powder caustic image stack. Kept for compatibility with the C02 middleware ('causticOvality'); the canonical representation is an observation of rps:CausticOvality."@en .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasCausticOvality> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has caustic ovality"@en .
# 
# http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasCoefficientOfDetermination
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasCoefficientOfDetermination> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasCoefficientOfDetermination> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasCoefficientOfDetermination> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#DataDrivenProcessModel> .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasCoefficientOfDetermination> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal> .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasCoefficientOfDetermination> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The coefficient of determination R² of a data-driven process model on its training data."@en .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasCoefficientOfDetermination> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has coefficient of determination"@en .
# 
# http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasConfidenceLevel
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasConfidenceLevel> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasConfidenceLevel> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasConfidenceLevel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityValue> .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasConfidenceLevel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal> .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasConfidenceLevel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The confidence level (between 0 and 1) associated with an expanded uncertainty or a prediction interval."@en .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasConfidenceLevel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has confidence level"@en .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasConfidenceLevel> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote> "OPEN ISSUE OI-2: to be aligned with the uncertainty models of B03 and A03."@en .
# 
# http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasCoverageFactor
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasCoverageFactor> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasCoverageFactor> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasCoverageFactor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityValue> .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasCoverageFactor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal> .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasCoverageFactor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The coverage factor k used to obtain an expanded uncertainty from the standard uncertainty (qudt:standardUncertainty) according to the GUM."@en .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasCoverageFactor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has coverage factor"@en .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasCoverageFactor> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote> "OPEN ISSUE OI-2: to be aligned with the uncertainty models of B03 and A03."@en .
# 
# http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasEstimatedCompletionTime
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasEstimatedCompletionTime> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasEstimatedCompletionTime> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasEstimatedCompletionTime> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#ReprocessingOperation> .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasEstimatedCompletionTime> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasEstimatedCompletionTime> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The completion time of a reprocessing operation as estimated by the specialized machine cell and reported to production control. Replaces the middleware term 'estimatedCompletionAt'."@en .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasEstimatedCompletionTime> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has estimated completion time"@en .
# 
# http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasLayerIndex
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasLayerIndex> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasLayerIndex> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasLayerIndex> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#DepositedLayer> .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasLayerIndex> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#positiveInteger> .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasLayerIndex> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The position of a deposited layer in the build-up sequence, starting with 1."@en .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasLayerIndex> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has layer index"@en .
# 
# http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasLowerPredictionBound
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasLowerPredictionBound> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasLowerPredictionBound> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasLowerPredictionBound> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityValue> .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasLowerPredictionBound> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal> .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasLowerPredictionBound> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The lower bound of the prediction interval of a model-based prediction, in the unit of the quantity value."@en .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasLowerPredictionBound> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has lower prediction bound"@en .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasLowerPredictionBound> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote> "OPEN ISSUE OI-2: to be aligned with the uncertainty models of B03 and A03."@en .
# 
# http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasMaterialDesignation
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasMaterialDesignation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
