# http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasOCTLayerHeight
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasOCTLayerHeight> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasOCTLayerHeight> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#OCTMeasurementSeries> .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasOCTLayerHeight> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal> .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasOCTLayerHeight> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Shortcut for the mean layer height in micrometres derived from an OCT measurement series. Kept for compatibility with the C02 middleware ('layerHeight'); the canonical representation is a process monitoring observation of rps:LayerHeight with a qudt:QuantityValue result."@en .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasOCTLayerHeight> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has OCT layer height"@en .
