# http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasPowderBatchIdentifier
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#hasPowderBatchIdentifier> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
