<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#AdditiveSubtractiveReprocessingProcess> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A production process that restores a damaged component by removing the damaged volume, rebuilding it by high-speed DED-LB/M and finish machining the functional surfaces. One component enters and one component leaves the process."@en .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#AdditiveSubtractiveReprocessingProcess> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Additive-Subtractive Reprocessing Process"@en .
