<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#SpecializedMachineCell> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The InRePro reprocessing cell of subproject C02 as the single externally addressed resource of the circular factory. It receives reprocessing operations from production control and decides internally on the sequence of process runs and the measurement systems involved. Replaces the middleware term 'SpecializedMachines' (singular noun required by the SFB modeling convention)."@en .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#SpecializedMachineCell> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Specialized Machine Cell"@en .
