<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#GUMTypeAEvaluation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#UncertaintyEvaluationMethod> .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#GUMTypeAEvaluation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Uncertainty evaluated by statistical analysis of a series of observations (JCGM 100:2008)."@en .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#GUMTypeAEvaluation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GUM Type A Evaluation"@en .
# 
# http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#GUMTypeBEvaluation
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#GUMTypeBEvaluation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#GUMTypeBEvaluation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#UncertaintyEvaluationMethod> .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#GUMTypeBEvaluation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Uncertainty evaluated by means other than statistical analysis of observations, e.g. from manufacturer specifications or calibration certificates (JCGM 100:2008)."@en .
<http://w3id.org/circularfactory/ReprocessingSystem#GUMTypeBEvaluation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GUM Type B Evaluation"@en .
